00:00:25.087 --> 00:00:26.880
- You can eat them and you can wear them.

00:00:26.880 --> 00:00:28.430
- Yeah. But they're really good for you.

00:00:28.430 --> 00:00:29.263
- Yes! They're very good for you.

00:00:29.263 --> 00:00:30.096
- [Kelly] Yeah, they're very good for you.

00:00:30.096 --> 00:00:30.929
I didn't know that.

00:00:30.929 --> 00:00:32.210
So how are your kids, both of your kids?

