00:01:04.670 --> 00:01:06.300
I think he's--
- Yeah.

00:01:06.300 --> 00:01:07.910
Oh! I know how to drive a stick

00:01:07.910 --> 00:01:10.120
but I refuse to have one
as a regular vehicle.

00:01:10.120 --> 00:01:10.953
- Yeah. I grew up driving it.

00:01:10.953 --> 00:01:12.340
- It's a lot.
- It's a lot.

00:01:12.340 --> 00:01:14.000
