00:01:48.050 --> 00:01:49.440
Are you, I mean,

00:01:49.440 --> 00:01:50.800
we're excited for whatever they wanna do,

00:01:50.800 --> 00:01:51.770
but do you worry about them

00:01:51.770 --> 00:01:53.540
