00:03:13.487 --> 00:03:15.650
"You don't think I worked
before I was on there?"

00:03:15.650 --> 00:03:17.370
I was like, "But okay, sure."

00:03:17.370 --> 00:03:19.560
And even if it was, it's
the longevity that counts.

00:03:19.560 --> 00:03:20.890
It starts staying there.

00:03:20.890 --> 00:03:22.840
But you and your family
recently had an estate sale

00:03:22.840 --> 00:03:23.673
which I think is awesome

00:03:23.673 --> 00:03:25.950
'cause my sister just had a garage sale.

00:03:25.950 --> 00:03:27.530
- [Amy] Okay.
- So in estate sale,

00:03:27.530 --> 00:03:29.210
- It's the same thing.
- It's like a fancy,

00:03:29.210 --> 00:03:30.520
it's a fancy garage sale.

00:03:30.520 --> 00:03:31.910
My sister was like so excited.

00:03:31.910 --> 00:03:33.310
We love garage sales.

00:03:33.310 --> 00:03:35.130
We didn't never venture to estate sales

00:03:35.130 --> 00:03:37.335
'cause we didn't have the
money if we were kids.

00:03:37.335 --> 00:03:38.168
But like, but is that what it is?

00:03:38.168 --> 00:03:39.310
It's like a fancy garage sale?

00:03:39.310 --> 00:03:40.309
I've never been to an estate sale.

00:03:40.309 --> 00:03:41.142
- You know what it is?

00:03:41.142 --> 00:03:43.740
It's like, well I'm a
massive collector of crap.

00:03:43.740 --> 00:03:44.940
So if you guys were online,

00:03:44.940 --> 00:03:45.855
saw what I was selling,
I have a lot of the art.

00:03:45.855 --> 00:03:47.780
- [Kelly] I think there's
a word for that; Hoarder.

00:03:47.780 --> 00:03:50.550
- Yes. My sister says that the
difference between hoarding

00:03:50.550 --> 00:03:53.087
and collecting are aisles.

00:03:53.087 --> 00:03:53.920
(Kelly laughing)

00:03:53.920 --> 00:03:55.430
So I'm sort of more of a,

00:03:55.430 --> 00:03:58.310
I'm gonna be torn
somewhere in between that.

00:03:58.310 --> 00:04:00.240
- Well I wanna show, this
is some of your stuff.

00:04:00.240 --> 00:04:02.270
So do you have a
fascination of creepy dolls?

00:04:02.270 --> 00:04:04.521
- Don't judge me, don't judge me.

