I just need to know.
- I don't know.

00:04:07.940 --> 00:04:09.630
I think if there are past lives,

00:04:09.630 --> 00:04:11.320
I'd have a few questions for myself.

00:04:11.320 --> 00:04:12.530
I don't.

00:04:12.530 --> 00:04:15.130
I mean, yeah, I don't even
know how to explain it.

00:04:15.130 --> 00:04:17.090
- [Kelly] But I actually would've
wanted that little number.

00:04:17.090 --> 00:04:18.520
Like the tribal thing, that's cool.

00:04:18.520 --> 00:04:19.440
Like hanging on the brick wall?

00:04:19.440 --> 00:04:20.273
That's cool.
- [Amy] Yeah.

00:04:20.273 --> 00:04:22.960
I mean, well, and the surfboard.

00:04:22.960 --> 00:04:24.210
- [Kelly] No I don't surf.
- Yeah.

00:04:24.210 --> 00:04:25.970
I got that when I turned 40

00:04:25.970 --> 00:04:28.543
and I learned to surf so I'm
gonna sign it an autograph.

00:04:28.543 --> 00:04:32.295
- I just turned 40 and I will
not be learning how to surf.

00:04:32.295 --> 00:04:33.390
(Kelly and Amy laughing)

00:04:33.390 --> 00:04:34.223
- I will not.

00:04:34.223 --> 00:04:36.800
- Were you ever terrified
of like sharks or anything?

00:04:36.800 --> 00:04:39.230
- No, no. And 40 was my best year.

00:04:39.230 --> 00:04:40.680
40 is gonna be your best year.
- 40 is already my best.

00:04:40.680 --> 00:04:43.290
It's been days and it's
already my best year.

00:04:43.290 --> 00:04:44.140
- Yeah, It's your best three days in 40.

00:04:44.140 --> 00:04:45.760
- [Kelly] Yeah, It's my best moment.

00:04:45.760 --> 00:04:48.970
No, it literally, I think
life gets exponentially

00:04:48.970 --> 00:04:49.880
