00:06:56.090 --> 00:06:57.240
or you didn't remember?

00:06:58.560 --> 00:06:59.771
Okay. I wanna know what's happening.

00:06:59.771 --> 00:07:00.604
(Amy laughing)

00:07:00.604 --> 00:07:01.520
Okay. I wanna know, I wanna know.

00:07:01.520 --> 00:07:03.080
I wanna know, don't lie.

00:07:03.080 --> 00:07:05.723
I wanna know what's happening right now.

00:07:05.723 --> 00:07:06.900
- This is total vanity.

00:07:06.900 --> 00:07:09.320
I mean, it's so stupid.
- I'm so excited.

00:07:09.320 --> 00:07:11.857
- First lemme just press it
by saying that my kids say,

00:07:11.857 --> 00:07:14.160
"Mom, you know you were
born in the 1870s."

00:07:14.160 --> 00:07:15.560
