00:07:23.647 --> 00:07:25.393
and I'm like, "Oh!"

00:07:25.393 --> 00:07:27.010
For me, I'm like, I see pictures

00:07:27.010 --> 00:07:28.410
I'm like, "Oh my God."

00:07:28.410 --> 00:07:29.830
- Like, you're not.

00:07:29.830 --> 00:07:30.663
- I don't even care.

00:07:30.663 --> 00:07:32.620
- But that's the thing,
- Like that's so good lucky.

00:07:32.620 --> 00:07:34.220
